      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِيَانٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِيَانَةٌ</span> inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَانَ</span> expl. in art.
