    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  The former, of which <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُيَانٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيَانٌ</span>
